            "We apply virtual, augmented, and mixed reality technologies to create digital simulations and guidance directly in the context of industrial operation. This allows teams to learn, practice, and execute tasks with more safety, efficiency, and standardization.",
        video: "/videos/home/realidade-digital.webm",
        image: RealidadeDigitalImg,
        accordions: [
            {
                title: "Virtual reality training",
